h_text","block_id":"SP9yo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00A26469-F9E7-49CE-A8C8-D0D68BD44473","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ダメなデザインはだいたいBadを踏み抜きまくってます。","ts":"1634905793.018300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R5H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CD31DC96-7946-4F98-A7C5-9CF29F0B4C8A","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"デザインは世の中の良くできたデザインシステムのGood/Badをとにかく頭に叩き込んで、実際に自分が設計する時に、このデザインの何がGoodで何がBadなのかを説明できるようにすれば、おおよそ外さないですかね。","ts":"1634905756.017200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iZ6O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1896848b-b8a6-4aa5-9f0e-d76ef428d185","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"デザインセンスないのでbootstrap使ってなくても気付いたらbootstrapっぽくなってたりする","ts":"1634905684.015500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yfp8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D62BB2E2-D98E-4473-A57F-73748F3A7101","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"フロントは複雑化の一途なので、悩んだらコードが少ない方（自動生成を除く）って感じですかね。あと、最近はRailsでいうところのCoCみたいなのを取り入れると良い気がしました。","ts":"1634905625.013700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X9V0O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67f19a65-694d-4ece-bd75-6b48dfbc7454","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"フロント、デザインセンスが無いので何もできない","ts":"1634905621.013600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gnW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9db960da-743c-468f-928d-7ffd24d8585e","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"実は言うほどベターじゃないプラクティスだったりもする","ts":"1634905351.010000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jxW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f4f0ff5-48a2-46a0-a562-71b9b51